From 39910c64b0063dd868c62a6de01ceb28555c7d69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:22:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Treasure Trails: medium clue scrolls

Medium tier on the cluehelper tables: anagrams, ciphers and npc cryptics with challenge scrolls
(cluehelper_challenge_question, count-dialog answer), coordinate digs, double emotes (Uri after the
first emote, the second before talking), npc/loc cryptics, key steps (an NpcDeathKillHook drops the
key for a player on the step), music, map digs and crates, medium Uri and STASH units (oak planks,
Construction 42), and the medium casket (the wiki's table, 3-5 rolls). STASH units take the
tier's plank and XP. Music scroll text now uses the wiki's wording.
